1
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:45,880
When words can't buy bread,

2
00:01:46,759 --> 00:01:48,759
and ink drains one's heart's blood,

3
00:01:48,759 --> 00:01:50,520
only to turn to ashes,

4
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:55,440
how many manuscripts must be burned

5
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:58,440
to build a paper ladder

6
00:01:58,840 --> 00:01:59,840
to the sky?

7
00:02:09,039 --> 00:02:10,840
Then there will be no more sorrow.

8
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:11,960
Isn't this ritual

9
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:15,080
interesting?

10
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:17,130
You are sick in the mind.

11
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:20,890
You should see a doctor.

12
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:22,320
A doctor?

13
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:28,840
When I had my miscarriage,

14
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:31,320
they told me

15
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:34,500
I could never get pregnant again.

16
00:02:35,160 --> 00:02:36,560
The doctor told me

17
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:40,480
I had severe postpartum depression.

18
00:02:45,079 --> 00:02:47,160
I've only ever loved you,

19
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:51,530
but I was forever deprived of the right to be a mother.

20
00:02:53,160 --> 00:02:54,320
Every night,

21
00:02:54,760 --> 00:02:55,600
when I miss her

22
00:02:57,160 --> 00:02:58,520
and have nightmares,

23
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:04,160
no one can help me.

24
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:09,920
No one can truly understand the pain of my depression after the miscarriage.

25
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:16,079
Now,

26
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:19,079
I've finally found a way.

27
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:23,880
Why aren't you drinking?

28
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,530
Do you want me to add some sugar?

29
00:03:30,040 --> 00:03:32,300
Can you tell me why you left without a word

30
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:35,160
three years ago?

31
00:03:38,600 --> 00:03:39,840
Couldn't we bear it together?

32
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:40,720
Did you think we

33
00:03:40,720 --> 00:03:42,250
couldn't bear it together?

34
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,600
Tell you?

35
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:46,960
And then what?

36
00:03:50,720 --> 00:03:52,980
Could you go on the operating table for me

37
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:57,840
and feel the pain of losing a child?

38
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:02,700
Or could you have my nightmares for three years,

39
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:05,040
unable to sleep,

40
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:07,120
until today?

41
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:15,000
Your mind is full of your dreams.

42
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:18,399
You only want success.

43
00:04:19,079 --> 00:04:19,959
Li Zhiwei.

44
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:23,240
We are here today

45
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:27,120
not only because of me,

46
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:30,160
but also because of your indifference

47
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:30,800
to me

48
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:33,880
and the child.

49
00:04:39,159 --> 00:04:40,720
Your obsession with success

50
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,560
and madness

51
00:04:42,159 --> 00:04:43,520
have harmed everyone.

52
00:04:45,640 --> 00:04:46,440
Mara,

53
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:48,520
Sophie,

54
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:50,360
Xiaotao,

55
00:04:55,159 --> 00:04:57,640
and our unborn child.

56
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:04,920
So if evil

57
00:05:05,080 --> 00:05:07,010
is crowned with the name of a dream,

58
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:09,480
is it no longer evil?

59
00:05:13,320 --> 00:05:14,560
I understand.

60
00:05:18,400 --> 00:05:19,360
I'm sorry.

61
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,560
I'm sorry.

62
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:39,200
I was the most selfish one.

63
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:43,520
Three years ago, I thought

64
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:45,560
if I wrote 50,000 more words,

65
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:47,240
I could buy you a better gift.

66
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:49,520
If I wrote 100,000 more words,

67
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:51,960
I could buy a bigger house.

68
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:02,000
I'm sorry.

69
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,960
I never put myself in your shoes

70
00:06:07,960 --> 00:06:09,800
and thought about you.

71
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:15,200
I'm sorry.

72
00:06:20,640 --> 00:06:22,360
But nothing can be undone.

73
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:27,320
If I can repay you,

74
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:30,940
it will have to be in the next life.

75
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:27,960
I'm sorry.

76
00:07:48,280 --> 00:07:48,920
Sophie.

77
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:03,720
Open the door.

78
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:04,880
Open it.

79
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:26,480
Sophie.

80
00:08:38,640 --> 00:08:40,240
Something's wrong with you.

81
00:08:40,280 --> 00:08:41,539
Don't come any closer.

82
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:47,840
Don't come any closer.

83
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:49,100
I'll kill you if you do.

84
00:08:55,520 --> 00:08:56,160
I was wrong.
